frame(x = [9223372036854775800, 10]).add(s = running(x, stat: sum))
---
error[Z0211]: Int overflow: the running sum does not fit in 64 bits at row 2
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:54
  |
1 | frame(x = [9223372036854775800, 10]).add(s = running(x, stat: sum))
  |                                                      ^ the column summed
  |
  = help: Ints are 64-bit; a Float (`1.0 * x`) holds larger magnitudes with 53 bits of precision

